{"job_id":"F-8afb439b97613af9b5cf","family_id":"F-8afb439b97613af9b5cf","title":"육군3사관학교 설치법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":11,"target_id":"bd7af615aa3e5fb9f80e0288f0d6a4ed0e47c3ab25ded6c71974bf3cd7c20002","source_hash":"7fa1f93b179359460b7647c362d2fe07aa3b9eff6b3f0e556c880d023582c8ae","text":"关于设立韩国陆军第三军事学院的法令"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":56,"target_id":"a9fbd97aa0e6079593bc76295c9d9b85bbfc07b69e4fad1bde0b3f29b4bea90b","source_hash":"ed1120fadfca0c27a8644aaf5cb0e029e0fb6498d08a6386092e4cff04cec6df","text":"第一条（设立）韩国陆军第三军官学校在陆军内设立，为成为陆军军官的人员提供必要的教育。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":56,"end":104,"target_id":"b10c861b23f75bf6eafccde292d7dc870c8ffc3a054d23cdb6603d9a613d8331","source_hash":"c7ecc1a7c0b6f1e239917a595720f829c9e903a78ac839475cb4ae1ed725fc41","text":"第二条（学习期限）韩国陆军第三军事学院（以下简称“学校”）的学习期限为两年。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":104,"end":406,"target_id":"a0f35888848e44a88c7105083416e9c0a4b520ce1778f7df9969ce15d9ad39fc","source_hash":"95737b78980b61e5f36aa6db33bcfc2c5e40aeb7d9e7247afe6a7ef269878c57","text":"第三条（入学资格）凡欲入学者，须符合下列各款规定。<2022年12月13日修订>\n1. 必须未婚，年龄在19岁至25岁之间。但是，如果申请人符合《退伍军人扶助法》第16条第1款和第2款规定的退伍军人资格，则入学年龄上限将按照总统令的规定予以延长。\n2. 不受《兵役人员法》第十条第二款规定的取消资格理由约束\n3。必须从专科学校毕业或拥有同等或更高水平的教育背景（包括那些在大学完成至少两年课程的人）。\n4. 达到学校规章规定的体能标准\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":406,"end":649,"target_id":"1b6434d444cd20adeca56be32c785f6037620645707cd6704283ce324e6bde9e","source_hash":"1270d31805095c8ed8823f41d56e21d91066f7ff4661ec9ae445ee6493743fda","text":"第四条（课程）\n① 学校课程分为军事课程和普通课程。军事课程事宜由国防部长决定，普通课程事宜由国防部长会同教育部长商议决定。<2013年3月23日修订>\n② 第1款所述课程足以授予学位。<2019年4月23日新增>\n③ 关于第1款所述的一般学术课程和设施，适用高等教育法有关大学的规定。<2019年4月23日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":649,"end":807,"target_id":"447bc7d9aaa72e18db8d1e4e058f4a1c90b16f240c09b6eb5ac9dd4c15871286","source_hash":"28b5d7c0b24f1494b1ee4b90f3aa1f99fe8af8d6ddde80f51526691e9a9e4af7","text":"第五条（校长等的任命）\n① 除校长外，还应按照总统令的规定，向学校任命教授等公职人员（包括军人和文职军人；以下同上）。\n总监由总统根据国防部长的提议，经陆军参谋长推荐，从陆军将领中任命。<2017年3月21日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":807,"end":1076,"target_id":"3864e3bd50b695c51ceef1c1d48aeb42cb6c3583256776d740d324a940cd22b2","source_hash":"249c971fb7bc0600b8dd8c9eb556a498d5d6ad4e5684749e9f42449e471e910c","text":"第六条（教授等的资格和聘任）\n①《高等教育法》第十六条的规定，照其需要适用于第五条规定的教授等负责教授普通学术课程的公职人员的职级和资格。\n② 负责第一款所述普通学术课程教学的人员中，教授和副教授由总统根据国防部长的建议任命，助理教授由国防部长根据校长的建议任命，助教由校长任命。<2011年7月21日修订>\n③ 总统可根据总统令，将第 2 款规定的任命教授和副教授的权力委托给国防部长。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1076,"end":1275,"target_id":"be3ba94a77ae4cbb7880a113f7391d505080b6e78cde23b91349189b0b0f5422","source_hash":"03a9a54d4df1f46888111f46e4cfa393a5e6e1fb8555847b3ab547a7aa1ab0c8","text":"第六条之二（《公共教育官员法》等的适用） 负责普通学术课程教育的非军事人员或文职军事雇员，应当指定为特定职级的公职人员。关于其任期，参照《公共教育官员法》第十一条之三的规定；关于其薪酬、培训、身份保障、纪律处分和申诉，分别参照《公共教育官员法》和《教师地位提升和教育活动保护特别法》的规定。<2016年2月3日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1275,"end":1315,"target_id":"cbdf7c6fc1f7637c1683e24e5797695ecd55ae9cba440f568c72afe65b62050b","source_hash":"b05854adf0e4c4163669c9aca0f0d58f53a216e4bfc9fe92258c42ccc4a69009","text":"第七条（毕业生的任命）从学校毕业的人，应当被任命为陆军少尉。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1315,"end":1397,"target_id":"0f4ce33ac9d41e445509364a35e7202e11ee8e21849438320f0be62ed137ca23","source_hash":"6fbfe80a17d64ddbd4975c49b03fff023a444cf072d76df0677aaac32dad9ee8","text":"第八条（授予学士学位）学士学位授予从学校毕业的人。学位授予的必要事项，例如学位类型，由总统令规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1397,"end":1418,"target_id":"8cf6440e27aca334390f8b1bb86e70d576ac1e695e7f1c0d9a52e965288e53dd","source_hash":"8cdec12471ed4f45d24d9678e0d775164b56d14e51eaefe574bc3ff926b72370","text":"删除第9条 <1994.12.31>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1418,"end":1784,"target_id":"0bf4e7f3794f8712a61801d6522fd72305d720cae4925588f5f3f73bc991eb07","source_hash":"5d3c26ff5bf1fe094ceb989f449ac0e5d97ff718199f9a064b954d5f47a8722c","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 2703，1974 年 12 月 21 日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（关于转学的过渡措施）根据陆军短期军官学校法令在陆军短期军官学校注册的人员和根据空军教育司令部法令在空军教育司令部所属飞行学校注册的人员，在本法实施时，应转入根据本法设立的短期军官学校。\n\n③（关于毕业资格的过渡措施）根据本法第2款规定调入短期军官学校的人员，以及在本法实施前根据陆军短期军官学校条例从陆军短期军官学校毕业的人员（限于高中毕业生或具有同等或更高学历，并已完成两年全部课程并毕业的人员），应授予专科院校毕业资格。<1978年12月5日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1784,"end":1920,"target_id":"1d557c151ae0d4a582ef919b4ec134559e3f3feba35fcfa2ca7ff93938a89f05","source_hash":"e4f8979e427791b23fd504fe61f2506fc845ccf71e3047ddf05841c4bd8480c9","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 3112，1978 年 12 月 5 日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自1979年1月1日起生效。\n\n②（关于毕业资格的过渡措施）本法实施前从短期军官学校毕业并获得专科院校毕业资格的人，适用本法第8条第2款的规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1920,"end":2162,"target_id":"ba57509e93eee14041766fbccb19495a4ba0e9c9c0c78f30154dc1ab69a63a2d","source_hash":"3b24d448cca53c91fd527ef171e6dc982136648c5a49282c02b5efdc5a217a35","text":"附录（军事文职人员管理法）<第3342号法案，1980年12月31日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②省略\n\n③（修改其他法律）在《武装部队组织法》第十二条第三款、第四款和第十六条；《国防研究生院设立法》第六条第一款、第三款、第四款和第七条；《军事院校设立法》第五条第一款；《短期军官院校设立法》第五条第一款；《空军技术高中设立法》第五条第一款；以及《军事刑罚法》第十条第一款第一项至第三项中，“军属”改为“军事文职人员”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2162,"end":2269,"target_id":"96bbb69f06fcb615dc81c3dc0add3c962186f9f6db7bd671af0d31e89d4a34fc","source_hash":"63528a7910105fb421477882e52316fcd9270ae333b7bdf0883c20308f4b7930","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 3456，1981 年 11 月 23 日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（过渡措施）在本法实施时受聘的全职讲师和助教，应视为已按照本法聘任。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2269,"end":2464,"target_id":"67c2643ecea0247131a38e723b261ea0e687d269e590f17f3ed33e879ff910e7","source_hash":"1207638ad7c8579f2319e4ba7665f335149e4d83e7de1e0166d1e1406af2bb20","text":"补充条款 <条款编号 3596，1982 年 12 月 31 日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自1983年1月1日起生效。\n\n②（关于在读学生的过渡措施）在本法实施时已在短期军事学院就读的人员，应视为根据本法已在学员课程就读的人员。\n\n③（关于毕业生的过渡措施）在本法实施之前从短期军官学院毕业的人，应视为已从本法规定的军官学员课程毕业。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2464,"end":2495,"target_id":"f6da8fdecbeecf7b2147a25da7c9d4776d95893eb3af7e4e211460dd6afee287","source_hash":"003db7c6cb4052faec38095433d19e94c4db356ad657a0816e6e52cd5a667654","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第4268号法令，1990年12月27日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2495,"end":2533,"target_id":"2b06627a18ddac6ec8d753433b3d39c8980951c05145bd74f1e0831786b54554","source_hash":"57592edde8f8d3b6e2ef6b7b41aa8a7bc16fba6b86566ba43ff28446d3e8b22e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2533,"end":2547,"target_id":"dcb0b1bcca0affab816c8f75e8ec290f8e77c8bd9c51720ac4c979917b7b917c","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2547,"end":2662,"target_id":"7afe61aa9d10ff0866f710da52918d755ee237441f8a24b4afd05b68beea26ff","source_hash":"c27042b9a3b9dc82db07363b1468f08d9627e503159fa2185e533a26a1dcd963","text":"第四条（教育部更名后对其他法律的修改）①至⑦ 已省略\n\n  ⑧ 《短期军官学校设立法》修改如下。\n\n  第六条第三款中的“教育部长”应改为“教育部长”。\n\n  ⑨ 至 <50> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2662,"end":2678,"target_id":"daba6ae7445bbe3f40cb19d34477eb52cc200fa94590e3424bf507de6f203ebe","source_hash":"a16a0cb59f6e4ef79bf0048439544ae9f6e5db2367a8d1e4270552898639fb49","text":"省略第 5 至 10 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2678,"end":2920,"target_id":"9ce6128d39dac85a3226000a6109f4d8989093dd9bf41211e2107e9c078e25cf","source_hash":"f3c9b2f226d2cdbfa54f32f8e7b9738aa67fe45d8747c8a34ce1500f9c49f1a4","text":"补充规定 <第4838号，1994年12月31日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自1996年1月1日起生效。但第九条的修正规定自1995年1月1日起生效。\n\n②（关于在读学生的过渡措施）本法实施时，短期军官学校本科课程的在读学生的课程设置、毕业和学位授予，适用先前的规定。\n\n③（关于在职助理教授的过渡措施）在本法实施时，在短期任职学校聘用的助理教授，应视为已按照本法聘任。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2920,"end":2950,"target_id":"f055932189899ee4612301cd2a9b5fad974e382168e0ef767774d28f131258b7","source_hash":"16de8f0d80da55f72a8fdc939d28a25af164f2de42be35f213239e869b3f0e7f","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第6400号法令，2001年1月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2950,"end":2988,"target_id":"3620daa352fde6a2bef461fcfd7c79ea825a4a25ee120871a27f2b0f25967a78","source_hash":"57592edde8f8d3b6e2ef6b7b41aa8a7bc16fba6b86566ba43ff28446d3e8b22e","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2988,"end":2996,"target_id":"6f3ff9ce14fe1d3fd6b820ef68bde76b97e40a1ac4fbe01961539e115a919aff","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"文章 2 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2996,"end":3122,"target_id":"5c3bbaba6701df2d778f0b74ba8b1eb5ae854a0d0d6a948e89215ae56f94220b","source_hash":"8f9527127a572ee6ed0033e516040c295bb0853614096b5cae838906a362ed43","text":"第3条（修改其他法律）①至<47> 已省略\n\n  <48> 《短期军官学校设立法》修正如下。\n\n  第 4 条第 1 款和第 6 条第 3 款中的“教育部长”应改为“教育和人力资源部长”。\n\n  <49> 至 <79> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00027","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3122,"end":3130,"target_id":"2dccc5c322ce953115b1badae1cb1855788e7af84a1cef158fd0fbca0831ff4a","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00028","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3130,"end":3264,"target_id":"f0856a00bde17113ff0e8b0a903e0d635a0c7034436858fc45a673ef56d24d7f","source_hash":"13e67381872abe8d751519d6fe34b7eb77aba2554de647d750e0483d40470f33","text":"补充规定 <第7089号，2004年1月20日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（关于女学员招募期的特别规定）根据第三条第一款修正规定进入短期军事学院的女学员的招募期，由总统令确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3264,"end":3288,"target_id":"d31758f868fcdb04ac5fd005db3b8afb56e92e064bc361a7421750350896ebd6","source_hash":"fdd03557f7540ed81c6394f11afeabb81ebe4fbd26079bf2ea4dc73dc3d98b41","text":"补充规定 <第7269号，2004年12月31日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3288,"end":3318,"target_id":"755109d1217caf99cdf8587eb3e93be8c551911ea08e29eb1eaf6d5aadd3d36a","source_hash":"270995b89d2309e194292fd88c46f67958024ea2d273d6ce7801f07d64f64eb9","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3318,"end":3556,"target_id":"a8c22d2469efd8ed4b47ef8e3374191a8d3a9c13e8136510fc1dade285d5e059","source_hash":"d15a87e992b7af00df0bdea412b6c635a97af2abbc66bceccd51aea2df9a6037","text":"第二条（关于原短期军官学校等的过渡措施）① 在本法实施时，根据原短期军官学校设立法（以下简称“短期军官学校”）在陆军中设立的短期军官学校，应视为学校。\n\n  ② 在本法实施之时，短期军官学校的课程、校长、教授等，应视为该校的课程、校长、教授等。\n\n  ③ 在本法实施时已从短期军官学校毕业的人，以及授予该等毕业生的学位，应视为授予该等毕业生和该校毕业生的学位。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3556,"end":3704,"target_id":"b5ce698e7cc19afef405db26ecb9494bfc20bb9211954a49805759e36782a383","source_hash":"93a8112040783210f633af08a4571f60b13ded6cc364fcde219c5d64caae4c29","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）《军事人员法》修改如下。\n\n  在第6条第3款、第7条第1款第2项的但书以及第11条第1款第1项和第2款第2项中，“短期军官学校”应改为“韩国陆军第三军官学校”；在第26条第4款中，“短期军官学校课程”应改为“韩国陆军第三军官学校课程”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3704,"end":3838,"target_id":"99da668c3026dc79399b856984e997c06638f8653cabb974e8654a5bae26fd76","source_hash":"fb93ad8dc474187fb6c17329a39989ba14bcf9953f34ffe2f686075844cd8047","text":"第四条（与其他法律的关系）在本法实施时，其他法律提及以前的短期军官学校设立法或其规定，而本法有相应规定，则视为已援引本法或本法的有关规定代替以前的规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3838,"end":3868,"target_id":"ab952700a12f9767adc6cf166c9311e864a6e2e06f9f659b4f74d798b7dc341e","source_hash":"9f984faffebd91642f1e26e75c1ab3649e306236dd38deee54e7ee1495f626a6","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第8852号法令，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00035","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3868,"end":4001,"target_id":"06e0656a5d40e7ded27cceb6d9e32478f381fbe6c2209796b7b72dd0ecfa9d40","source_hash":"521d8e5ab1ea8ad1965b0fa0941c6967f3b0e929ccafe8637d1746922053d134","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……，根据补充条例第六条修正的、在本法生效前已公布但生效日期尚未到来的法律部分，自各法律的生效日期起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00036","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4001,"end":4018,"target_id":"46b798ed584c13b8e225b02d912a04fd1dea268931f8803732c6a201bbcb6f6c","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00037","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4018,"end":4157,"target_id":"dad48f9c1c60008491d973ab448007b022422a015ab51187a1a11e754df3c8a5","source_hash":"648a7c31bf48826435a8a2358e52bfffcc11478f9d99265cc4ad290ce62235fd","text":"第六条（修改其他法律）①至<181> 已删除\n\n  <182> 《韩国陆军第三军事学院设立法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第 4 条第 1 款中的“教育和人力资源部长”应改为“教育、科学和技术部长”。 \n\n  <183> 至 <760> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00038","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4157,"end":4165,"target_id":"28b8cb840a7cbb81d9a26e227347fedbc5cf9c86a01ba5b7143271aa75daba88","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00039","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4165,"end":4209,"target_id":"5b0e3442dc1ddc40dd4d6473aa348e8d309f9157735e8180b0bcfe513b588f67","source_hash":"5957fca56c964e058ce15f9d66aa9ce2dfbb47cc583ed3d7b4565bbceac10e4d","text":"补充规定 <第10216号，2010年3月31日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00040","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4209,"end":4240,"target_id":"efb1ce7ea403605cad654beeb62137d2c036e11bad4022e0909a35fde5c7a2c0","source_hash":"2c55e29f034a9fb0b927e9e3b8a63ee428f404ebb79e30257405d97ac9444d13","text":"增补（高等教育法）<法案编号 10866，2011 年 7 月 21 日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00041","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4240,"end":4314,"target_id":"a4ea0db4326c23dc330e783eb1897ba155339e14728224130e04d238bb5cf437","source_hash":"6e30f6b43d483b873b7bce1e3d2a9855eabf76e918bde56015b6a2ed7bd45e11","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……附录第三条自公布之日起一年后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00042","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4314,"end":4322,"target_id":"d912a76f7daecf4f8df532872fa61d051584811fc60153590f283afb99fbfbe4","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00043","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4322,"end":4443,"target_id":"214f34c5f5b8e3fe974106a93707e045bb57b9789a806011896681770b6e75d1","source_hash":"99380101d8dabd532b10f5523ca26003aeb2b936099b65b18a0abdfa598545fb","text":"第三条（其他法律的修正）①至<18>款已省略\n\n  <19> 《韩国陆军第三军事学院设立法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第六条第二款中的“全职讲师和助教”应改为“助教”。\n\n  <20> 至 <27> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00044","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4443,"end":4451,"target_id":"b1a74a4d535460e899beacfc0eb10f836a7fb05962bc09287c049de072bf28d3","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00045","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4451,"end":4475,"target_id":"1ef61a35a3375e0c4b318346bdf7805f435455b3f31b32b1167646b2963790e4","source_hash":"6b6e3308b30694895f9dbeaf6685761b24e88457f07cd0e74871fe55b45ab519","text":"补充规定 <第11638号，2013年3月22日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00046","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4475,"end":4504,"target_id":"f3f543e81bbb056013e6624e37dc0e43fa0d46c781be4723905e51a13a5199f5","source_hash":"fb5b512a97e9ea37002f61bddc2be78ed1fd3a84c0a6dca866bf42b810b2e6f7","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00047","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4504,"end":4585,"target_id":"eaaa17dfddc07b989317afedb3533e66a47fc5dc9a748100185ce59a9b590b21","source_hash":"48e918c8498d23cac91fd9828e1c1bcba54251c3c52a79b3970769f3fd225fd2","text":"第二条（适用于《公共教育官员法》等）第六条第二款的修正规定适用于本法实施后首次负责教授普通学术课程的人员。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00048","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4585,"end":4616,"target_id":"335663d473e627dccfd8ec8f23d790801a7180a2e2709e98f0547eafafbbc9ac","source_hash":"884b1766aaddfed62f208e70764e5d43694b510475476512e06be6a0808c47af","text":"附录（政府组织法）<第11690号法案，2013年3月23日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00049","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4616,"end":4655,"target_id":"5095efd351e6f4689fa38d97ae2c2c8680fc83f167544817457038be103477d7","source_hash":"11264c491a84d09dc371820c68fae870846004c0353283ed56de4b9c8d25c060","text":"第一条（生效日期）① 本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n  ② 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00050","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4655,"end":4672,"target_id":"0b22e6ce723b9ba3702b7d938d99382dc1e48f5306283de2ef609e8b52e185f8","source_hash":"90d7c234b09875f89ed9e65d48d7911823d8886f04f0ff283113cd913ec46436","text":"省略第 2 至 5 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00051","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4672,"end":4802,"target_id":"ed6aa16933b73c412862414e871cbc41f21a8d47a8adf4ceb36b57ce426694b3","source_hash":"a52c7bf392aa847baa9cd8b65375ea2a9c3f7d72f38a41110800daa987aa0f1a","text":"第六条（其他法律的修正）①至<146>款已省略\n\n  <147> 《韩国陆军第三军事学院设立法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第四条第一款中的“教育、科学和技术部长”应改为“教育部长”。\n\n  <148> 至 <710> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00052","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4802,"end":4810,"target_id":"f6a61af4cdc1980de5c69456be0e904cc6a0d70d5861c9f5b006fc94094b59d4","source_hash":"d09f0bf027445fd59687bbc043e112a369a0ea4231afb55cde2e72e071f90c65","text":"第7条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00053","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4810,"end":4862,"target_id":"10c274f29d6df921a7d9d9f3916ea148affeab2ad4fc6c7b09a4134387e0c727","source_hash":"5b08c2843bc276b861803c8088d4b4aabff9b52012f588c77fb051be92fbec1a","text":"补充条款（关于改善教师地位和保护教育活动的特别法）<2016年2月3日第13936号法令>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00054","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4862,"end":4901,"target_id":"e63cbf854e8f65d28f0b2081bb81cea6af99fc3aeb8b9fbb8a86317f9af8a1a8","source_hash":"25ab8090219c7238abfcb9c5def1d259d4a6ffcd42cc55b280b8993c845bc68c","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00055","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4901,"end":4909,"target_id":"c346d3acc61e7c6f3dc95d595eaa393dbbf0faaca9695268981e3f3b93292f2f","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00056","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4909,"end":4970,"target_id":"818f634847c938533567fa7c09aa81285b9de40e0066bebc2d904e983942bc0c","source_hash":"1bba9862571da63651b899c621f2e2aac9838f0a85cb496e313893f6ebe1ddf7","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至⑦ 省略\n\n  ⑧ 《韩国陆军第三军事学院设立法》部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00057","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4970,"end":5039,"target_id":"77bbe33f263cf53fa12183963f1cbcc8842f2d3d5398ec7dc4515b220d4f2336","source_hash":"b37d6f3af9819ca452802c60ed9d710b9a9429b16278a5048d414e18bf8c7333","text":"  在第6条第2款中，“「改善教师地位特别法」”应改为“「改善教师地位和保护教育活动特别法」”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00058","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5039,"end":5047,"target_id":"efcb03cdf1f3bbf5197400e5de5328d9600a59318fe34ebfb437ee648c2fd987","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00059","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5047,"end":5077,"target_id":"e14b02eb17112cedc9f28419522073604006b20245665d30d16374efc19ba28d","source_hash":"9fbfcbc6c92beb2350783154bbc98ec3ed761c661fa758082486f29d049b6df1","text":"补充规定（军事人员法）<第14609号，2017年3月21日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00060","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5077,"end":5124,"target_id":"b3512ce875eb0370d589e91d1c8f6b8c2afc497cb48a0a120c91c5e5338cbab2","source_hash":"4fa885529d27745733697f970a6158cd7179a6fc497d7318cac75d9ff08614a0","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自公布之日起三个月后生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00061","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5124,"end":5227,"target_id":"0f818d3919886f9401bd32755ce76fd260595463a1811e78194a1bb54571d208","source_hash":"40ef938f28288a7e8de45809a810e41d38c045472eeebdfefd9f24774b3d435c","text":"第二条（其他法律的修正）①至<18>款已省略\n\n  <19> 《韩国陆军第三军事学院设立法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第 5 条第 2 款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00062","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5227,"end":5235,"target_id":"cf5a78a7043c3732c07a358739921f5456b115817ac420a3261f20b8ef3dbd49","source_hash":"fab18bd1e0d74a271eea817ca2d5dff62d53ec4d5214a8c48af3c4adbab54a93","text":"第 3 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00063","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5235,"end":5279,"target_id":"b8e6ea150ef2c64563803b8c56e35e6283b46434223a9efb0323c9cb31b1ead5","source_hash":"6ff35e3bc1562073248ff92c2910adb5bb7aa19cb0c5a8e24ad19c635ca5a78f","text":"补充规定 <第16357号，2019年4月23日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00064","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-000947-245999-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5279,"end":5332,"target_id":"b56766d5c6fdfe9672b657bb0ea9d8eec8f9be9fafcf0b720eb445e9f826bfef","source_hash":"fe6748bdabf3b8bf8c04bfa8d637c0d510c06ae7b34bdde64cc2df8dce87c014","text":"补充规定 <第19083号，2022年12月13日>\n\n本法自公布之日起六个月后生效。"},{"id":"B2-zh-00001","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":15,"target_id":"39c276f3a65b76c6f6932812441f1794d00c701904a7dc715c2b6820b1d83ba6","source_hash":"8809bccbb5e43461b44078af22409b18cbe2442162cfb6ad266ca0ef409c9c97","text":"《韩国陆军第三军校设立法》实施细则"},{"id":"B2-zh-00002","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":78,"target_id":"8fccfa429bf809bf44b6a2f4264e5276c44fb327bfbfd25d8f90fc368e9b825d","source_hash":"18f84424fabf6819d71e0816a13f74185b8b0272b721c4b3473d37e704c8b19d","text":"第一条（目的）本法令的目的是规定根据《韩国陆军第三军事学院设立法》在陆军内设立的韩国陆军第三军事学院的组织和运作事项。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00003","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":78,"end":127,"target_id":"2aa08b97c6be2a82deec5f63d4b30312a2db47f14bee24cfe1dc87cf019ecbde","source_hash":"92e9e08f4125d3172ed3ed7bbfe3030bcee9a7eab78a16ecbca768ec00316145","text":"第二条（地点）韩国陆军第三军事学院（以下简称“学校”）的所在地为庆尚北道永川市。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00004","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":127,"end":294,"target_id":"ff78359ce7abcc5efa8eb227a78bda4416f3ed4d349421c0ad4bd7f1747cbfaf","source_hash":"e7cf2ef0975d3372ddf173daf3c2dcd94147da6ed1ec3076a4ca34ffe6fc3b49","text":"제3조(사관생도)\n① 학교에서 수학하는 사람을 \"사관생도\"라 한다.\n② 学员入学当天即登记入陆军学员军事名册（根据第9条第2款规定临时入学除外）。\n③ 军官学员的待遇应与准尉相同。但是，薪酬应按照《军人薪酬法》的规定执行。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00005","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":294,"end":417,"target_id":"93c0b8e7c8497fbc2a06859d37a456fbcfc48a78d9fe644178148c7bb046a97b","source_hash":"89aee7d2ba5862ac3bd417752c655341beb3730d4ef19b5ed7b919459258fdfc","text":"제4조(교장)\n校长在陆军参谋长的命令下，负责监督学术事务，并指挥和监督其指挥下的教职员工。\n② 如果校长因不可抗力无法履行其职责，则由系主任、学员队指挥官或参谋长中的资深人士代为履行其职责。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00006","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":417,"end":903,"target_id":"1ea6a3c076a37c03dbf3ceb287221f3e085efbc5762a976133e32d7cf6e7336e","source_hash":"2208499d8af429522b93f5cb7c8d83bbb6fdd3099cdb0ea78cd54f85dac50816","text":"第五条（部门的设立等）\n① 学校应设有教务处、学员队和参谋部，并可设立其他必要的部门和单位。\n② 교수부에는 교수부장을, 생도대에는 생도대장을, 참모부에는 참모장을 두며, 각 부서 및 부대에 각각 장(長)을 둔다.\n③ 学院院长、学员团指挥官和参谋长由陆军参谋长根据总监的推荐，从将级军官或校级军官中任命；其他部门和单位的负责人由总监从校级军官或连级军官中任命。<2017年9月5日修订>\n④ 교수부는 일반학과정의 교육에 관한 사항을, 생도대는 훈육과 그 밖에 교수부가 분장하는 교육 외의 교육에 관한 사항을, 참모부는 교무와 그 밖에 다른 부서 및 부대가 분장하지 아니하는 사항을 각각 분장한다.\n⑤ 제1항의 그 밖에 필요한 부서의 설치 및 사무 분장에 관한 사항은 국방부장관의 승인을 받아 육군참모총장이 정하고, 그 밖에 필요한 부대의 설치 및 사무 분장에 관한 사항은 국방부장관이 정한다.\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00007","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":903,"end":1016,"target_id":"14f98e1e1b25a6290f02ae8fbceec849190690285bc1a097ce2e5f7d14925a31","source_hash":"beb1dbbfe164daaf5b703a2a653ea20b79d6309611671ff404f267d1197bc7f4","text":"第六条（教员、教授等）本校应设教员负责军事科学课程的教学，并设教授、副教授、助理教授（以下统称“本校教授”）及助教负责普通科学课程的教学。<2012年2月29日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00008","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1016,"end":1227,"target_id":"079cac7b7d24b3bf247ff7dbb82fba68780436b767b9b6e39e171e4ca7a42e01","source_hash":"3f4cc196b9681d7b67ea46c6c9818d43ddc9a5a91bceb0c09765518404a4fb5f","text":"第六条第二款（教授和副教授的聘任）\n① 根据《韩国陆军第三军事学院设立法》（以下简称“该法”）第6条第3款，总统授权国防部长任命负责通识课程教育的教授和副教授。\n负责普通学术课程的教授和副教授，应由学校负责人根据第20条第1款的规定，经教育指导委员会同意后，向陆军参谋长推荐，陆军参谋长再向国防部长推荐。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00009","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1227,"end":1357,"target_id":"db19f8b3b59df8fd2216ab3e78b5822eb34b9e61caa4a0af06d821a8651cab30","source_hash":"ff920d6ae200a32e866989805ab4a6d8a9e69110484ea72a15f6550cc3d7a785","text":"第七条（人员配额） 军事人员和文职军事人员应当分配到学校任教，其人员配额由国防部长确定。在此情况下，普通学校教师和担任教学助理的军事人员或文职军事人员的人员配额，应当按照高等教育法第二条第一款的规定确定（以下简称“大学”）。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00010","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1357,"end":1475,"target_id":"832be0c3e1af523e9943dba61908fb3e8649727e7e4cf338aebe1b20299592d3","source_hash":"31d6556ccaeba2ae46ba517106024909eceefda12d4ff4a7bd53501b5d6021fd","text":"第八条（准入等）\n① 除其他法律另有规定外，学员的入学、退学和休学均须经校长批准。\n② 사관생도는 입학 지원자 중 국방부장관이 정하는 바에 따라 선발시험을 거쳐 선발한다.\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00011","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1475,"end":1700,"target_id":"e15336518b42abf3e81aaf0ea9aceb366b504a234be7bef00df9d32ed017747f","source_hash":"aea866bdb36ff7062d52c7fc8c7358ce12d2fdbfd89990c306a2c69c4ab70762","text":"第8条之2（入学年龄上限的延长）根据本法第3条第1款但书的规定，退伍军人（以下简称“退伍军人”）根据《退伍军人扶助法》第16条第1款和第2款规定的入学年龄上限延长如下：\n1. 2년 이상의 복무기간을 마치고 전역한 제대군인: 3세\n2. 1년 이상 2년 미만의 복무기간을 마치고 전역한 제대군인: 2세\n3. 1년 미만의 복무기간을 마치고 전역한 제대군인: 1세\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00012","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1700,"end":1892,"target_id":"05d1b6fe54e33f9ffd46af5d7103244d737339ec50d2fae2c1aa4a5dbd222aa7","source_hash":"a42c270a842a9bdc3f6f8a83cddfff69b1ddde4434436cd63f95cd10f3d9a437","text":"第九条（入学时间等）\n① 根据第 11 条规定，学员的入学期限应在学年开始后的 30 天内。\n② 校长如有必要进行预备教育，可允许通过选拔考试者在正式入学日期之前临时入学。\n③ 根据第2款规定，临时入境期限不得超过50天。\n④ 제2항에 따라 임시 입학한 사람에게는 급식과 의복을 지급한다.\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00013","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1892,"end":1948,"target_id":"ffb9c4a5338dc8cf8caa75c9ba26ee1969f164f38ecdbedf050d69e0a5ff7f24","source_hash":"b24537eaae7ee83dce64d3d2632e7cfa3950ed22c7987454c3c421217aeba244","text":"第十条（课程）学校的课程由学校规章决定，普通学术课程的课程按照大学的课程规定确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00014","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1948,"end":2082,"target_id":"cf73fed1405d69318cc73ff56005c897bccb93c4fca2a5d5662a8e9e5779dc47","source_hash":"9eddc5741b84f107dcc50d19a349f89aecaaaa1f585d4b0fb9df9f19c82cebf7","text":"第十一节（课程完成单位）学校的课程完成单位为学年，学年分为第一学期和第二学期，具体如下：\n1. 제1학기: 3월 1일부터 그 해의 8월 31일까지\n2. 제2학기: 9월 1일부터 다음해의 2월 말일까지\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00015","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2082,"end":2146,"target_id":"6c944b03d2ed68dfb5135ce5c34a5d4d439f18f7b9ecf31cc8e650dcb62c889b","source_hash":"548d64490f1631c40b7652b5ae1f7baef16273fe9f3f642748a6650b4121359e","text":"第十二条（上课天数）上课天数由学校规章确定，普通学术课程的上课天数按照大学的上课天数确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00016","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2146,"end":2194,"target_id":"d979130a2a7a0590f95b81b10f9156cb319c7ed8b4c9920521837a93a5699668","source_hash":"3cd457c578bf1a31a015c068641fd8e7e2af9aeec9e6397c4cf50732bdc31c4e","text":"第十三条（上课和放学时间）校长决定上课和放学时间。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00017","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2194,"end":2388,"target_id":"cd77d6616db08f080f335a51c2f52fe7961bcdf019601f4463f352fb7fb0bdd9","source_hash":"11d8521f0d67123946d6f730d8441230d70bc19d01077c7558bcee87c90cb93e","text":"第十四条（停职天​​数等）\n① 학교의 휴업일은 다음과 같다.\n1. 관공서의 공휴일\n2. 개교기념일\n3. 학칙에서 정하는 하기 및 동기 휴가\n4. 국방부장관이 정하는 군(軍) 행사일\n② 如遇紧急情况、灾害或其他突发事件，校长可暂时停课。停课情况下，校长应立即向陆军参谋长报告。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00018","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2388,"end":2462,"target_id":"c7b6f9d3de59929efe8e87fe492643f8e8f84b5b3af9a90f6befb58184783aaa","source_hash":"2ad509161a6e7c853d8d75d98deaedad422f74eec291cd1f81e9f0ad32a7cd59","text":"第十五条（派遣教育）校长经国防部长批准，可以派遣学员到国内其他学校或单位或者国外学习。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00019","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2462,"end":2501,"target_id":"6358c3904a29ea7743cfcf9c90eab3146541f564df81e4dfce2356c6d3a73053","source_hash":"015794510f8af1d8667d40645e4004cb1f8200200c4229f9b19f45b5b3c575ac","text":"第十六条（转学等）学员不得转学和入学。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00020","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2501,"end":2706,"target_id":"4bf49645231b640109443dccf5db7e9380ed35682363a292c5aa02fd373cbb47","source_hash":"8a0d27bb5cb2174d83f0e16c9edee387a02989fe971557ea61b8e6f4bb3a84d6","text":"第十七条（学年课程及学位等的完成）\n① 为了认可学员完成学年课程并毕业，必须事先对其成绩进行评估。\n② 根据本法第8条规定，理学学士学位授予自然科学专业的学生，​​文学学士学位授予人文社会科学专业的学生，​​工程学学士学位授予工程专业的学生；授予学士学位的其他必要事项，如学位类型，由学校规章确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00021","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2706,"end":2963,"target_id":"693c8044ef4b18085f5bc27d301490bc74e5c7f0811206183c14972a797d0aa4","source_hash":"9cdbaa56dca90d1219b06ff665c1ac43bb9bf9af37fbc5fc0a6b20e71d1be954","text":"第十八条（驱逐理由）\n① 校长可以开除符合下列任何一项规定的学员。\n1. 품행이 매우 불량한 생도\n2. 군기(軍紀)를 문란하게 하는 등 사관생도로서 지켜야 할 규칙을 준수하지 아니한 생도\n3. 학업성적이 불량하여 졸업할 가능성이 없는 생도\n4. 질병이나 그 밖의 심신의 장애로 인하여 정해진 과정을 이수할 수 없는 생도\n5. 학칙을 위반한 생도\n② 根据第 1 款被开除的学员，应于开除之日从其军人名册中删除。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00022","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":2963,"end":3289,"target_id":"65323a80c2b8720d1533b4de45e883866ffaf5d3be25fd507d6c9520d36e1b94","source_hash":"7738ae9015e839594b95e15521fe4b6d731985bb2ffab386a2beaf3da885dbf8","text":"第十九条（学校规章）\n① 교장은 국방부장관의 승인을 받아 학칙을 정한다.\n② 国防部长在批准学校规章制度前，应当征得教育部长的同意。修改学校规章制度时亦应如此。<2013年3月23日修订>\n③ 学校规章应当规定下列事项：\n1. 학년ㆍ학기와 휴업일에 관한 사항\n2. 학급 편제와 사관생도의 정원에 관한 사항\n3. 교과 및 수업일수에 관한 사항\n4. 학년과정 수료의 인정과 평가에 관한 사항\n5. 입학ㆍ퇴학ㆍ휴학 및 졸업과 상벌에 관한 사항\n6. 졸업 자격에 관한 사항\n7. 제20조에 따른 교육운영위원회의 운영에 관한 사항\n8. 그 밖에 학교의 운영에 관한 사항\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00023","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3289,"end":3542,"target_id":"fbb36ba01a3bd734bbf259a66b0b3e4bf3ca78b92d937296f885dc628d75170a","source_hash":"cf9cf076f0847c531e07076e3b1bd0c689194b755b987108474629590e17bdfc","text":"第20条（教育指导委员会）\n① 学校应设立教育运营委员会（以下简称“委员会”），负责回应校长关于教育运营的询问。\n② 委员会由教务长、学员指挥官、参谋长以及校长指定的五至二十名军人或文职人员组成。\n③ 委员会主席应为系主任或学员队指挥官中级别较高的人。\n委员会主席主持会议，召集委员会会议，并担任主席一职。\n⑤ 위원회의 운영에 필요한 사항은 학칙으로 정한다.\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00024","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3542,"end":3646,"target_id":"65bd5bd7d761a1dae1cd07a001c6165124af1ed3b20ccaf6f107b5e44bdb3800","source_hash":"4784373c2b243c8c8495ec9fe8a2d4e747e9bd1cba762013d93d198844fee6e3","text":"第21条（女学员招募期）根据《短期军事院校设立法》（第7089号法案）第3条第1款和该法附录第2款的规定，自2015学年起，韩国陆军第三军事院校开始招募女学员。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00025","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3646,"end":3804,"target_id":"f6ba4fe9f7de6c069581065b72195c71232e1af9f162a93ca69c556740d3699e","source_hash":"36a0e6211245b1bb30e2cf38d90366a2a6dfde85536fa518a3ccc1413e696740","text":"第 22 条（唯一身份信息处理）根据《个人信息保护法实施条例》第 19 条第 1 款，如果为履行下列各款规定的职责所不可避免的，委托人可以处理包含居民登记号码的数据。\n1. 법 제3조에 따른 입학자격 확인에 관한 사무\n2. 법 제8조에 따른 학위 수여에 관한 사무\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00026","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3804,"end":3854,"target_id":"2a3a0540515efda2b60be1420577c128a484595bb7af7960401cdbd6b7abb140","source_hash":"10dde4549ef7cb77a75b21d7a71897fade835b6fd14c92ec7ba457058033d34b","text":"부칙 <제14651호,1995.5.19>\n\n本法令自1996年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00027","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3854,"end":3895,"target_id":"a31c82348cd2fa7f0ca799db04a29b07f81f23a654f310addde76a7d98aa6a0b","source_hash":"302418fea95deb0ebaa3264580fec4705b5003ca951fa815140995e39acb1b04","text":"增编（教育部及人力资源部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第17115号，2001年1月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00028","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3895,"end":3925,"target_id":"71d54aae019b2ad3265b05afc3531535bff8db87aad0ad6434c250e947124111","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00029","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3925,"end":3940,"target_id":"a1a4e4b199015c7af1ad05456a7c9c87de5ff45aa9dd23dfbada60718eb40b0e","source_hash":"119c19aa8cf5d20a95854f948299b43b564b2b8788981249c71d35dec8490177","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00030","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3940,"end":4062,"target_id":"ad1abd923428afbf6a9aef3015de37336637f338c26e47f2f714c0d3ab0643fb","source_hash":"18e92de4762d6fa31df2f5b9509eecc75d7e60c4a795929b8478a8fc599ecdad","text":"第五条（修改其他法律）①至<77> 已省略\n\n  <78>단기사관학교설치법시행령중 다음과 같이 개정한다.\n\n  第十九条第二款第一部分中的“教育部长”应改为“教育和人力资源部长”。\n\n  <79>내지 <152>생략\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00031","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4062,"end":4105,"target_id":"6d9ba2dfb484e34c2bacf44ab74aaf5145b5a7af67eec4f193164028dec89017","source_hash":"4e5df8e84f425c2d01cca63c9f791b35eae606ad61291172141f065c33158843","text":"부칙 <제18538호,2004.9.9>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00032","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4105,"end":4129,"target_id":"cfe734b1e2a772becc47d9da826e81a8f15154d232bed246169b1215387882a8","source_hash":"14f02425399d5dc702ce0bf09d6a248d0397729f6a28960564cdac082a9a9ea5","text":"补充规定 <第18972号，2005年7月27日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00033","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4129,"end":4159,"target_id":"2e7587c6cf516b063fb5c1bea153cca7a2f81818f6546e8bc2b465c7f70e79bb","source_hash":"40ac608cf2787f4f50a97c8b940ad8db5f2f59c445aea0216bf6cbd54d933b82","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00034","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4159,"end":4209,"target_id":"2e696a4338c1657cf659e817576e1bdbefac851fec5bf16daa2b388526cf3081","source_hash":"e72af465e118ad545af6c37fea28b3f98bbdbf48dfaa45d767d07f39130dd68b","text":"第二条（修改其他法律）①对公务员津贴等规定的一部分修改如下。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00035","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4209,"end":4557,"target_id":"31ade4c8e98005dbc93d2cef971746acee1b5ea2790f3134575de1374c80acbf","source_hash":"7ca800d4ed3bb495d75697aa919f3b947a23e992350b3121dd1c777d22806c11","text":"  在附件表 11（特殊任务津贴支付分类）第 2 项第 (a) 6) 款规定的资格、金额和支付方式栏中，“短期军官学校”应改为“韩国陆军第三军事学院”。\n\n  ②《军事人员法实施令》部分修改如下。\n\n  第八条第一款第二项和第十五条第一款第三项（b）项中，“短期军官学校”应改为“韩国陆军第三军事学院”。\n\n  ③ 《兵役法实施令》部分内容修改如下。\n\n  在第30条第1款和该条第4款第1部分中，“短期军官学校”应改为“韩国陆军第三军官学校”。\n\n  4. 对《承认信用等法》实施法令的部分内容修改如下。\n\n  第九条第一款第四项规定如下。\n\n    4. 「육군3사관학교 설치법」에 의한 육군3사관학교\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00036","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4557,"end":4597,"target_id":"cfe168ea71cf2ab65c5b0221b726247267b6e271b851623ea8cbc44303b86db2","source_hash":"3bbd35c4552b6d9a751dd31a67a7e638a8e58da2002dde925a7799c92d23d115","text":"增编（国防部及其附属机构的组织结构）<第20675号，2008年2月29日>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00037","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4597,"end":4626,"target_id":"7d8e9b82cab4c794a14f465d50d67cf18ac19e172c12c30a59d125f8f6eb1790","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00038","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4626,"end":4640,"target_id":"15ae799ab41ecc285c06393b70245990afafe846ae6996dff30ebe7d7c912bdb","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00039","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4640,"end":4782,"target_id":"9a82733ba99626e6c9d1b02431ffd91264b6936d5de1365f5f1c6910b5cbadb0","source_hash":"56ed86319d0f5aa6372ad42b1e8d3c23b52aa5592d149641aa5c8b35b41032eb","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<22>款省略\n\n  <23> 육군3사관학교 설치법 시행령 일부를 다음과 같이 개정한다.\n\n  第十九条第二款第一部分中的“教育和人力资源部长”应改为“教育、科学和技术部长”。\n\n  <24> 부터 <30> 까지 생략\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00040","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4782,"end":4825,"target_id":"6e1d62a26ce9d0aaec6539837b72d99eb91a15b0311326afad0e5e01a3ea2d95","source_hash":"f73bcf7b2eef8022c1a98acf19f0e284a264f60f91f79d17b5151d466d0248c4","text":"부칙 <제22659호,2011.2.8>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00041","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4825,"end":4869,"target_id":"c0cb5d62f31248218851c2abf626ba8c4013c2e97bd299b55455ae781219f1fb","source_hash":"56ee5b0d95f30044bc275784dea513b23a97e658b04e12abbad1470615c170de","text":"补充规定（大学教师资格标准等规定）<2012年2月29日第23644号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00042","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4869,"end":4953,"target_id":"629575df0402e4f0ccc95bb198699b8621fca149500c35523b576d1de453d26e","source_hash":"e810f4e243fc6362e506ac72c72579bc801de0e7b339a69059913c72cfb886ba","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。但是，……<省略>……附件第二条和第三条的修正规定自2012年7月22日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00043","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4953,"end":4961,"target_id":"2f10ed3426bbb830d8c4ab47d8dfb257e8e3fa552beeb8967fe0527c55a8d9aa","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00044","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":4961,"end":5032,"target_id":"bc6fdd0d80890d378ebb6ddada4ad60cb73e2e36ff90c6f14204f21c3e81afd4","source_hash":"1ff7482356fa4464c1e286383d585c5448e82672c30ea44093ea64e06c045da6","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至<48>款省略\n\n  <49> 육군3사관학교 설치법 시행령 일부를 다음과 같이 개정한다.\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00045","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5032,"end":5096,"target_id":"8e502fafa074ce27af87938f5f6d2a17d3382e056652dffa79c947acd1cd4970","source_hash":"c1bad324188af9b71befbec7672422c27dbd4e6a982fb0eb3f259c67050c1089","text":"  第 6 条中的“副教授、助理教授和全职讲师”应改为“副教授和助理教授”。\n\n  <50>부터 <69>까지 생략\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00046","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5096,"end":5104,"target_id":"7c6719982371200372d21dfdadd452e8ebbec66d2b3cea844b50d45db17b79ab","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00047","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5104,"end":5144,"target_id":"503b0519d886b67b5d5324d0b7c4034b2948c20304fe7be4ffe6e89541a4d2fd","source_hash":"ff6f25ff86490fda66dcfbd21c8fbf51192d7fdbb2370dc7d7477d407e53d397","text":"增编（国防部及其附属机构的组织结构）<2013年3月23日，第24413号>\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00048","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5144,"end":5173,"target_id":"5bc14e801bed24c6f4a1f7969f507e5d0f8c0c234b4cf7a5908c482f0a30bd5c","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00049","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5173,"end":5181,"target_id":"4d770104d5f2939809e917d0e83190ce7f6952d80453073c35ed568368c4d4c8","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B2-zh-00050","doc":"B2","law_id":"kr-003285-251391-ko","scope":"BODY","start":5181,"end":5315,"target_id":"86b994feb19670d905835c710178d92aa0d4cb42b325b1ccfb92bdc6b4c394d2","